 "notes": [
  "First full quarter including IHS Markit (merger closed 28-Feb-2022). Segments: MI, Ratings, Commodity Insights (CI), Mobility (MOB), Indices, Engineering Solutions (ES) + Equity in Income on Unconsolidated Subsidiaries line.",
  "Three-month 2022 column is 'Adjusted' (actual scope); the comparatives and six-month figures are non-GAAP pro forma adjusted. Adjusted 2022 Q2 figures exclude the contribution of divested businesses ('Divestitures' line: OP -15, NI -11, EPS -0.03). The divestiture line is recorded per segment as 'divest' and in ngaap.items (cat OTHER, label 'Divestitures').",
  "Segment check op + nongaap + deal_amort = adj_op fails for MI (by -8) and CI (by -7 / rounding) because of the separate 'Divestitures' line; MI 702 - 491 + 133 - 8 = 336 \u2713; CI 141 + 21 + 32 - 7 = 187 vs 188 (rounding). Indices 270 - 35 + 9 = 244 vs 243 and ES 1 + 2 + 15 = 18 vs 17 (rounding).",
  "Gain on dispositions printed (556) = gain: gain_disp = +556 (MI 518, Indices 38). Equity income (11) = income. Other income, net (1) = income.",
  "Loss on extinguishment of debt, net 2: separate IS line below OP, kept in other_lines (-2, income sign); EBT 1,391 = 1,482 + 1 - 90 - 2; check_rec 'op+oth-int = ebt' fails by 2 for this reason.",
  "Segment expense table total 1,511 is net of the gains and equity income (IS expenses 2,078).",
  "RELEASE DOES NOT TIE: footnote after-tax items (excluding the Divestitures line) sum to -211 (incl. tax items +53 and debt-extinguishment +1) vs aggregate 'Adjusted non-GAAP adjustments' -221 (-0.65/sh); 972 - 211 + 216 - 11 = 966 vs adjusted NI 955; 972 - 221 + 216 - 11 = 956 ~ 955. MI items pre-tax sum -492 vs printed -491; corporate items 142 vs printed 143; ES 1 vs printed 2 (rounding).",
  "Indices adjusted operating profit attributable to the Company (Adjusted Indices net operating profit): 171 (NCI share 72).",
  "corp_nongaap / corp_deal_amort in add-back sign (reduce unallocated expense).",
  "cfpub six months; capex and nci_dist recorded as positive outflows. Adjusted FCF = 'Non-GAAP pro forma adjusted free cash flow excluding certain items' 1,625 (six months). Cash flow line now 'Distributions to noncontrolling interest holders' (no ', net'); a separate 'Proceeds from noncontrolling interest holders' +410 is printed.",
  "rev_type is the 'Adjusted revenue' by type (excludes divestitures; total 2,970 vs GAAP revenue 2,993).",
  "Guidance had been suspended on 1-Jun-2022 and is reintroduced here (GAAP and non-GAAP pro forma adjusted).",
  "CI adjusted revenue printed 427 vs 438 - 12 = 426 (company rounding)."
 ],
